WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.250
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:06.520 --> 00:09.200
-You want to audition as a singer here? -Yes.

3
00:09.280 --> 00:12.320
I suppose this is one way for you to convince Phatee

4
00:12.400 --> 00:13.600
to take your job, right?

5
00:14.560 --> 00:16.079
-Do you trust me? -I trust you.

6
00:16.160 --> 00:17.440
Then I'm sorry in advance.

7
00:17.520 --> 00:18.880
You're pretty naughty.

8
00:18.960 --> 00:20.200
Incense doesn't work on you,

9
00:20.280 --> 00:21.720
but the moment we kissed, you showed up.

10
00:22.480 --> 00:23.520
Vann!

11
00:23.600 --> 00:24.720
I'm not afraid of ghosts.

12
00:24.800 --> 00:26.640
I'm more afraid of not being with you.

13
00:26.720 --> 00:30.240
Garlah said my life would be ruined because of a man.

14
00:30.320 --> 00:32.479
So she doesn't like you dating men.

15
00:33.080 --> 00:34.120
Where are you?

16
00:34.200 --> 00:35.920
Come out and talk to me.

17
00:54.960 --> 00:56.240
Where are you?

18
00:56.320 --> 00:57.760
Come out and talk to me.

19
00:58.960 --> 00:59.760
Stop hiding.

20
00:59.840 --> 01:01.840
You come into my dreams almost every night.

21
01:01.920 --> 01:03.560
Just coming out to talk to me

22
01:03.640 --> 01:04.680
can't be that hard, right?

23
01:09.040 --> 01:10.720
I know you're around here.

24
01:11.600 --> 01:13.080
Aren't you protective of Rakkhun anymore?

25
01:33.960 --> 01:35.320
Okay.

26
01:35.400 --> 01:36.800
Now it'll be easier for us to talk.

27
01:36.880 --> 01:38.640
Let's make a deal.

28
01:39.680 --> 01:41.880
Are you sure you want to do this?

29
01:42.920 --> 01:44.080
I'm sure.

30
01:44.160 --> 01:45.280
Or I wouldn't have summoned you.

31
01:45.360 --> 01:47.120
You have issues. I understand.

32
01:47.200 --> 01:48.840
But don't give other people issues too.

33
01:48.920 --> 01:50.560
What era are we living in?

34
01:50.640 --> 01:51.960
People accept it now.

35
01:52.040 --> 01:54.040
Rakkhun's life won't be like yours.

36
01:54.640 --> 01:56.200
How can you be sure

37
01:57.080 --> 01:59.680
Rakkhun won't end up like me?

38
02:01.080 --> 02:02.080
Then how about this?

39
02:02.840 --> 02:04.120
I'll guarantee it.

40
02:04.200 --> 02:05.960
If you let Rakkhun go

41
02:06.040 --> 02:08.080
and his life falls apart because he's dating Kan,

42
02:08.160 --> 02:10.720
-I'll take responsibility. -How will you do that?

43
02:13.560 --> 02:15.320
Anything.

44
02:15.400 --> 02:16.600
Name it.

45
02:18.040 --> 02:19.400
Your life.

46
02:21.760 --> 02:24.920
If Rakkhun gets his heart broken,

47
02:25.000 --> 02:26.560
you die!

48
02:27.680 --> 02:28.920
You want my life?

49
02:29.000 --> 02:31.760
Otherwise, Rakkhun must live the life I want.

50
02:38.680 --> 02:40.360
If it costs me my life,

51
02:40.440 --> 02:41.920
you'll disappear for good

52
02:42.000 --> 02:43.840
and never make things hard for him again, right?

53
02:44.440 --> 02:45.400
Yes.

54
02:47.040 --> 02:48.480
But if Rakkhun

55
02:49.360 --> 02:52.000
gets his heart broken from dating a man,

56
02:52.720 --> 02:54.080
you must die!

57
03:03.600 --> 03:04.720
Okay.

58
03:07.280 --> 03:10.520
If you change your mind and want to cancel the deal,

59
03:11.480 --> 03:13.640
there's nothing you can do to change it.

60
03:14.520 --> 03:16.200
I always keep my word.

61
03:17.280 --> 03:18.720
Then from now on,

62
03:19.960 --> 03:21.680
your life

63
03:21.760 --> 03:23.240
belongs to me.

64
04:46.960 --> 04:48.160
I'm afraid that

65
04:48.800 --> 04:50.960
if we're too close, the ghost will show up.

66
04:55.040 --> 04:56.120
Then…

67
04:59.000 --> 05:00.880
shall we test it?

68
05:00.960 --> 05:02.760
See if the ghost shows up.

69
05:08.520 --> 05:09.600
What are you doing?

70
05:10.240 --> 05:12.280
Well, I'm testing it

71
05:12.800 --> 05:14.080
to see if the ghost shows up.

72
05:18.680 --> 05:20.200
I don't think you should risk it.

73
05:29.440 --> 05:30.600
Thank you.

74
05:30.680 --> 05:32.000
You can head back now.

75
05:55.040 --> 05:56.400
We're closed.

76
06:00.000 --> 06:01.000
Vann.

77
06:02.600 --> 06:03.800
Rakkhun.

78
06:03.880 --> 06:05.040
How did you get here?

79
06:26.160 --> 06:27.720
Did you see Garlah?

80
06:28.360 --> 06:29.760
Did Garlah come out?

81
06:32.160 --> 06:33.840
What exactly did you come here to do?

82
06:34.600 --> 06:35.800
When I was with Kan,

83
06:35.880 --> 06:37.440
Garlah didn't show up.

84
06:37.520 --> 06:39.720
I thought she might be gone,

85
06:39.800 --> 06:41.480
so I came to test it with you.

86
06:43.880 --> 06:45.720
So that kiss was you testing it?

87
06:45.800 --> 06:47.880
I don't think that's appropriate.

88
06:47.960 --> 06:49.480
Next time, test it with Kan.

89
06:50.280 --> 06:51.600
What are you annoyed about?

90
06:51.680 --> 06:54.480
You kissed me to lure Garlah out before.

91
06:55.240 --> 06:56.880
Well, it's my job.

92
06:56.960 --> 06:59.600
So, you really didn't see Garlah?

93
07:00.960 --> 07:02.840
Let me try again, in case she didn't see it.

94
07:02.920 --> 07:04.680
I don't think she's coming anymore.

95
07:06.600 --> 07:07.600
How do you know that?

96
07:08.600 --> 07:10.280
I've already talked to her.

97
07:10.360 --> 07:12.160
I told you I could do it.

98
07:12.240 --> 07:14.080
Are you sure?

99
07:14.680 --> 07:17.040
She won't come back and snap your neck later, right?

100
07:19.000 --> 07:21.840
As long as she's gone, you're okay with that, right?

101
07:21.920 --> 07:23.200
I did it.

102
07:23.280 --> 07:24.720
I kept my promise exactly.

103
07:24.800 --> 07:27.080
From now on, you can live however you want.

104
07:27.160 --> 07:28.680
You can have a boyfriend

105
07:28.760 --> 07:30.120
or enjoy yourself.

106
07:30.200 --> 07:31.120
You can fall in love.

107
07:31.200 --> 07:33.000
Whatever you want to do, you can do it.

108
07:35.360 --> 07:37.200
Aren't you happy?

109
07:37.280 --> 07:39.000
This is what you wanted.

110
07:39.600 --> 07:41.080
What about what you want?

111
07:43.400 --> 07:45.400
What I want is to finish the job.

112
07:45.480 --> 07:47.560
Job done, I get paid.

113
07:47.640 --> 07:49.840
Then I can go study like I planned.

114
07:50.440 --> 07:52.800
Soon you'll have to call me an engineer.

115
07:53.520 --> 07:56.120
That's really all you want, right?

116
07:56.720 --> 07:58.640
You've never wanted anything else from me?

117
08:08.400 --> 08:09.400
Yes.

118
08:10.280 --> 08:12.280
I'm here because I need the money.

119
08:17.400 --> 08:18.240
Okay.

120
08:19.280 --> 08:21.040
Then I'll consider this job finished.

121
08:30.440 --> 08:32.679
I'm glad I met you, Vann.

122
08:37.480 --> 08:39.080
Thanks for everything.

123
09:13.200 --> 09:15.200
It's better to end it this way, right?

124
09:38.360 --> 09:40.720
Vann, are you up?

125
09:49.480 --> 09:52.360
Rakkhun, what are you doing?

126
10:37.000 --> 10:38.000
Want some?

127
10:41.320 --> 10:42.560
Mimi, put it over there.

128
10:46.920 --> 10:47.960
Hey!

129
10:49.240 --> 10:50.520
Vann, what's wrong?

130
10:50.600 --> 10:52.480
You keep sitting there sighing.

131
10:54.080 --> 10:55.320
With symptoms like this,

132
10:55.400 --> 10:57.400
I give it a ten out of ten.

133
10:57.480 --> 10:58.600
He's definitely heartbroken.

134
10:59.600 --> 11:00.800
Heartbroken?

135
11:00.880 --> 11:02.400
Who broke your heart?

136
11:02.480 --> 11:04.600
Tell me. I'll go beat them up.

137
11:04.680 --> 11:07.520
How dare they break your heart when all you've got is your good looks?

138
11:09.960 --> 11:10.800
Tangmo, are you insulting him?

139
11:13.040 --> 11:14.520
Are you heartbroken over Rakkhun?

140
11:16.760 --> 11:17.960
Rakkhun?

141
11:18.040 --> 11:19.520
The one who came to me for a reading?

142
11:19.600 --> 11:20.880
Stop it.

143
11:20.960 --> 11:22.240
I'm not heartbroken.

144
11:22.320 --> 11:23.880
I just haven't slept much.

145
11:23.960 --> 11:25.840
-That's all. -"Haven't slept much."

146
11:37.200 --> 11:39.240
One million just hit your account!

147
11:39.320 --> 11:41.040
Vann, Rakkhun paid you that much?

148
11:41.120 --> 11:42.960
You finished the job already?

149
11:43.560 --> 11:44.840
I did.

150
11:44.920 --> 11:46.560
We don't have to see each other anymore.

151
11:49.160 --> 11:50.600
If you're not happy,

152
11:50.680 --> 11:51.920
just give the money back.

153
11:53.240 --> 11:54.920
You got that much money,

154
11:55.000 --> 11:56.760
so why aren't you happy like you usually are?

155
11:59.680 --> 12:01.120
Are you going to study abroad right away?

156
12:01.200 --> 12:02.640
You've got all the money now.

157
12:02.720 --> 12:04.480
I've already applied.

158
12:04.560 --> 12:06.600
I planned to leave as soon as this job was done.

159
12:06.680 --> 12:07.680
Hey, Vann.

160
12:07.760 --> 12:09.200
Why so sudden?

161
12:09.280 --> 12:11.000
You didn't tell us anything.

162
12:11.080 --> 12:12.640
Exactly.

163
12:12.720 --> 12:15.160
Won't you stay and save up some pocket money first?

164
12:17.080 --> 12:19.040
Sooner or later, he has to go anyway.

165
12:19.560 --> 12:21.120
Good luck, Vann.

166
12:22.560 --> 12:23.600
Hey.

167
12:23.680 --> 12:25.800
We should be happy for him.

168
12:25.880 --> 12:27.160
He gets to continue his studies

169
12:27.240 --> 12:28.960
and pursue his dream.

170
12:31.040 --> 12:34.360
Then, if there's anything we can help with,

171
12:34.440 --> 12:35.600
just let us know.

172
12:36.640 --> 12:38.120
Except money.

173
12:40.200 --> 12:41.320
Thank you so much.

174
12:42.160 --> 12:43.600
Thank you, everyone.

175
12:46.480 --> 12:47.880
Thank you too, Linda.

176
12:48.560 --> 12:50.200
I couldn't have done it without you.

177
12:51.360 --> 12:52.800
Hey, Vann.

178
12:52.880 --> 12:54.520
Give yourself some credit.

179
12:55.200 --> 12:57.200
I just brought you the job.

180
12:57.280 --> 13:00.040
You finished it yourself.

181
13:01.720 --> 13:03.400
Irasshaimase.

182
13:04.680 --> 13:06.440
Hai! Vann-san.

183
13:07.640 --> 13:08.480
Hey.

184
13:08.560 --> 13:10.240
Don't forget our souvenirs.

185
13:10.320 --> 13:11.640
-Got it? -Hey.

186
13:11.720 --> 13:13.080
My skincare and makeup too.

187
13:13.160 --> 13:15.040
-I messaged you. Read it. -And my mochi.

188
13:15.120 --> 13:18.040
-I want the real thing. -You can eat mochi in Nakhon Sawan.

189
13:18.120 --> 13:19.840
I don't care. But tonight,

190
13:19.920 --> 13:21.000
Vann's treating us.

191
13:21.080 --> 13:23.040
-Vann's treating us! -Really?

192
13:23.120 --> 13:25.360
How about Omakase? I want it. I've never had it.

193
13:25.440 --> 13:27.160
-Yeah, you got a whole million. -Please?

194
13:27.240 --> 13:31.160
-Treat us. It's not that expensive. -You're treating all of us.

195
13:48.720 --> 13:50.400
Customers aren't allowed back here.

196
13:52.280 --> 13:54.000
I'm not here as a customer.

197
13:57.080 --> 13:58.360
Today I'm here as a singer.

198
14:05.920 --> 14:07.520
You want to sing here?

199
14:08.760 --> 14:11.120
Sorry, I haven't rehearsed with you at all.

200
14:11.200 --> 14:12.800
You take the lead today.

201
14:12.880 --> 14:14.160
I'll follow you.

202
14:18.240 --> 14:20.160
We sing with our backs to the audience, right?

203
14:21.360 --> 14:22.480
Doing this

204
14:22.560 --> 14:24.760
won't get you an answer from me any faster.

205
14:28.080 --> 14:30.680
You're used to your comfort zone, aren't you?

206
14:31.960 --> 14:32.960
But it's okay.

207
14:33.520 --> 14:36.120
I'll let you test the system on me first.

208
14:36.200 --> 14:39.160
If we end up in the same band,

209
14:39.240 --> 14:41.280
we'll have to sing together, right?

210
14:42.560 --> 14:44.960
I think singing here first is a good idea.

211
14:45.040 --> 14:47.160
Then I'll know if our voices work together.

212
14:51.040 --> 14:52.480
Who said I'd sing with you?

213
14:54.960 --> 14:56.560
We're singing separately for an hour each.

214
14:58.000 --> 14:59.280
Wait.

215
14:59.360 --> 15:01.000
Wait, wait, wait.

216
15:01.080 --> 15:03.280
I was hired to perform as a duo,

217
15:03.360 --> 15:05.040
not solo.

218
15:05.120 --> 15:06.120
No.

219
15:10.320 --> 15:11.320
Hey.

220
15:11.960 --> 15:13.320
Are you scared of me or something?

221
15:14.200 --> 15:16.680
Afraid you'll lose fans if you perform with me?

222
15:17.400 --> 15:19.480
If it works,

223
15:19.560 --> 15:21.760
then you can consider my offer.

224
15:21.840 --> 15:23.960
But if it doesn't, we'll go our separate ways.

225
15:24.880 --> 15:26.440
I won't bug you again.

226
15:29.240 --> 15:30.240
Okay?

227
15:54.200 --> 15:55.960
Not working today, Mr. Writer?

228
15:57.160 --> 15:58.040
No.

229
15:58.120 --> 15:59.480
I just want to drink today.

230
16:04.760 --> 16:05.880
I can order myself.

231
16:06.680 --> 16:08.240
Consider it on the house.

232
16:08.320 --> 16:10.400
You're paying our bar anyway.

233
16:14.080 --> 16:15.520
Has work been too much lately?

234
16:16.400 --> 16:18.000
You look sleep-deprived.

235
16:19.880 --> 16:21.480
I haven't been sleeping well.

236
16:21.560 --> 16:23.080
Thoughts keep running through my head.

237
16:23.840 --> 16:25.160
If you'd agreed to help from the start,

238
16:25.240 --> 16:26.440
I wouldn't be this exhausted.

239
16:26.520 --> 16:29.520
Is overthinking normal for writers?

240
16:29.600 --> 16:31.720
You could say it's normal,

241
16:31.800 --> 16:33.880
but you could also say it's not.

242
16:34.560 --> 16:36.520
Anyway, I'm fine.

243
16:36.600 --> 16:38.600
I'll drink until I black out.

244
16:38.680 --> 16:39.920
Then I'll fall asleep.

245
16:46.840 --> 16:48.520
Then I'll drink with you tonight.

246
16:58.560 --> 17:00.280
Wouldn't it be better to hire someone else?

247
17:01.720 --> 17:02.920
Then let me ask you.

248
17:03.000 --> 17:05.200
When choosing a boyfriend, what do you look for?

249
17:05.720 --> 17:07.440
If he makes a good first impression,

250
17:07.520 --> 17:08.560
I go talk to him.

251
17:08.640 --> 17:10.680
If we click, I'll give it a shot.

252
17:11.359 --> 17:13.119
If we don't, we go our separate ways.

253
17:13.200 --> 17:14.599
No strings attached.

254
17:14.680 --> 17:15.680
Simple as that.

255
17:16.520 --> 17:18.800
But it can't be just anyone, right?

256
17:18.880 --> 17:20.880
The male lead in my novel is the same.

257
17:20.960 --> 17:22.560
I already picture him as you.

258
17:22.640 --> 17:23.960
It has to be you.

259
17:26.520 --> 17:28.520
You don't even know me that well.

260
17:28.600 --> 17:30.520
My looks

261
17:30.600 --> 17:32.120
might be fooling you.

262
17:32.200 --> 17:33.680
Inside,

263
17:34.200 --> 17:36.120
I'm far from what you think.

264
17:37.640 --> 17:38.560
Can't help it.

265
17:38.640 --> 17:40.360
I've already decided

266
17:40.440 --> 17:41.600
to wait for you to change your mind.

267
17:43.920 --> 17:46.080
That day will never come, Mr. Writer.

268
17:47.800 --> 17:49.920
But if it's a different kind of relationship…

269
17:52.360 --> 17:53.360
I could be down.

270
18:43.640 --> 18:44.720
Ready?

271
18:47.800 --> 18:48.800
Come on.

272
18:51.880 --> 18:55.000
What's with you? Show me some effort.

273
18:57.800 --> 18:58.800
Are you okay?

274
18:59.960 --> 19:01.000
Whoa.

275
19:06.880 --> 19:08.320
Yoyeh.

276
19:46.080 --> 19:48.400
At this rate, you won't get ten million.

277
19:48.480 --> 19:51.000
That's why I'm here practicing with you.

278
19:51.800 --> 19:53.400
You still have time.

279
19:55.080 --> 19:56.160
Besides,

280
19:57.280 --> 19:59.120
I already have you helping me.

281
20:00.120 --> 20:01.880
How do you know I'll help you?

282
20:02.560 --> 20:05.120
Taking your job doesn't mean I'll help you.

283
20:05.800 --> 20:07.720
I might just go for a stroll

284
20:08.240 --> 20:09.840
and wait to get paid.

285
20:11.160 --> 20:13.120
Are you just fucking with me

286
20:14.360 --> 20:16.800
or making excuses to spend time with me?

287
20:18.920 --> 20:20.680
You're full of yourself, aren't you?

288
20:25.520 --> 20:27.320
I'm not.

289
20:28.520 --> 20:30.240
But it's obvious from how you're acting.

290
20:47.960 --> 20:49.200
I'm going back to work.

291
20:50.280 --> 20:51.280
Time's up.

292
20:51.920 --> 20:53.320
Let's train again later.

293
20:54.480 --> 20:55.760
See you. Bye.

294
20:59.680 --> 21:01.640
Is it really that obvious?

295
21:07.880 --> 21:09.240
Vann isn't here.

296
21:12.760 --> 21:14.240
Have a seat.

297
21:18.440 --> 21:19.680
Where did Vann go?

298
21:21.880 --> 21:23.080
He's not here anymore.

299
21:24.360 --> 21:26.400
You mean he's already gone abroad to study?

300
21:26.480 --> 21:28.080
Why didn't he tell me anything?

301
21:29.080 --> 21:30.720
He just went back to his mother's house.

302
21:31.280 --> 21:33.960
He hasn't gone to Japan yet. Don't look so shocked.

303
21:35.880 --> 21:36.720
But, oh, well,

304
21:37.520 --> 21:38.880
good thing you're here.

305
21:39.440 --> 21:41.400
Can you take this book to Vann?

306
21:43.240 --> 21:44.320
At his house.

307
21:53.440 --> 21:55.480
I'll send you the location.

308
22:09.400 --> 22:10.640
Linda.

309
22:10.720 --> 22:12.560
Didn't you say you love all the Crows equally?

310
22:12.640 --> 22:14.840
Now you're role-playing Cupid.

311
22:15.480 --> 22:16.400
Find someone for me too.

312
22:16.480 --> 22:18.080
You just keep talking nonsense.

313
22:18.640 --> 22:20.240
Move on from your ex first.

314
22:20.320 --> 22:22.120
I've moved on.

315
22:22.200 --> 22:23.960
-Really? -Really!

316
22:47.760 --> 22:49.200
Is Dad helping you?

317
22:50.200 --> 22:51.240
The lottery results are out.

318
22:51.320 --> 22:53.320
He's in no mood to help me.

319
22:55.040 --> 22:57.320
Don't tell me you've been doing this all by yourself.

320
22:58.360 --> 23:00.760
Well, how else am I supposed to pay the bills? Look.

321
23:00.840 --> 23:02.120
The fridge is broken.

322
23:02.200 --> 23:03.880
The shop isn't doing very well either.

323
23:03.960 --> 23:05.840
So money's a little tight.

324
23:06.520 --> 23:07.800
From now on,

325
23:07.880 --> 23:10.040
save some of the money I send you.

326
23:10.120 --> 23:12.800
As for the shop, if you can't manage, close it for now.

327
23:12.880 --> 23:14.400
Wait until I come back to help you.

328
23:16.120 --> 23:17.840
Why worry about me now?

329
23:17.920 --> 23:19.720
I can take care of myself.

330
23:22.160 --> 23:23.520
Even though I

331
23:23.600 --> 23:25.400
haven't been a very good mother…

332
23:26.000 --> 23:29.080
It's my first time having a child, after all.

333
23:30.760 --> 23:31.760
But you

334
23:33.600 --> 23:34.840
have done so well.

335
23:40.720 --> 23:42.840
You've really done so well.

336
23:50.840 --> 23:52.480
Don't get all sentimental on me.

337
24:04.880 --> 24:06.920
TOM YUM NOODLES

338
24:08.520 --> 24:10.520
-Let's go! -Let's go.

339
24:13.040 --> 24:18.320
TOM YUM NOODLES

340
24:18.400 --> 24:20.040
Yo!

341
24:20.120 --> 24:21.120
How are you?

342
24:23.360 --> 24:24.400
What's with you guys?

343
24:24.480 --> 24:25.480
Why are you all here?

344
24:26.200 --> 24:27.640
I'm leaving tomorrow.

345
24:29.520 --> 24:31.920
Tangmo, didn't you say he was leaving today?

346
24:33.520 --> 24:35.000
Did I remember wrong?

347
24:36.040 --> 24:38.040
But I remember you're leaving today.

348
24:38.120 --> 24:39.600
Did you remember wrong, Vann?

349
24:39.680 --> 24:41.000
How could I remember wrong?

350
24:41.080 --> 24:42.520
I'm really leaving tomorrow.

351
24:45.760 --> 24:46.800
So,

352
24:46.880 --> 24:48.480
has anyone come to see you yet?

353
24:49.480 --> 24:51.320
Who would come see me?

354
24:51.400 --> 24:52.640
Just you guys.

355
24:53.760 --> 24:55.400
You really don't have to see me off.

356
24:56.120 --> 24:57.520
I'll only be gone a few years.

357
25:04.480 --> 25:05.840
What's wrong?

358
25:05.920 --> 25:07.120
Why are you crying?

359
25:07.200 --> 25:09.120
I'm going to study, not to die.

360
25:10.240 --> 25:13.560
I'm crying because I'm happy

361
25:14.240 --> 25:15.920
that from now on,

362
25:16.520 --> 25:17.960
I won't have to hear you

363
25:18.040 --> 25:22.200
nagging my ears off anymore.

364
25:25.440 --> 25:27.080
Just admit you'll miss me.

365
25:27.160 --> 25:28.680
Stop crying already.

366
25:29.560 --> 25:30.600
I'll bring you some skincare.

367
25:34.520 --> 25:37.520
Then I'll send you pictures. There's a lot that I want.

368
25:38.760 --> 25:40.640
Can I message you?

369
25:41.320 --> 25:42.240
I knew it.

370
25:42.840 --> 25:45.080
I can't tell if you were crying or just acting.

371
25:46.840 --> 25:49.160
-I was really crying, but… -Okay, okay.

372
25:49.680 --> 25:50.720
Here.

373
25:52.040 --> 25:53.600
It's made of lucky stones.

374
25:53.680 --> 25:56.400
It'll keep you safe from harm.

375
25:56.480 --> 25:57.680
Give me your arm.

376
25:58.520 --> 25:59.880
Wear it.

377
26:00.880 --> 26:01.960
Can you put it on?

378
26:04.560 --> 26:06.720
I made this myself last night.

379
26:06.800 --> 26:09.200
See if it really keeps you safe.

380
26:10.480 --> 26:12.040
Am I your guinea pig?

381
26:12.120 --> 26:15.200
Let's call you my first customer.

382
26:15.920 --> 26:16.960
Okay?

383
26:18.520 --> 26:20.280
And I…

384
26:20.360 --> 26:23.080
I've sent you a list of places to visit.

385
26:23.160 --> 26:24.480
I'm telling you,

386
26:24.560 --> 26:26.760
getting some rest is important.

387
26:26.840 --> 26:28.880
I've picked out a massage place for you.

388
26:28.960 --> 26:30.520
-Tangmo. -Tangmo.

389
26:36.800 --> 26:39.000
Here. Your pocket money.

390
26:40.960 --> 26:42.240
Hey.

391
26:42.320 --> 26:43.480
You…

392
26:44.280 --> 26:46.280
Everyone at the bar chipped in for you.

393
26:46.360 --> 26:48.440
I just exchanged it for you.

394
26:49.920 --> 26:52.400
Now that's a heartfelt gift.

395
26:53.000 --> 26:54.200
Thank you!

396
26:57.560 --> 26:58.840
You're acting like a kid.

397
27:02.800 --> 27:04.640
-You exchanged it already? -Yeah.

398
27:06.560 --> 27:08.080
And before you go,

399
27:08.640 --> 27:09.880
have you cleared things up with Rakkhun?

400
27:19.960 --> 27:21.480
I don't know what there is to clear up.

401
27:22.240 --> 27:23.920
The job's done. We go our separate ways.

402
27:25.360 --> 27:27.080
I'd rather stay single and focus on studying.

403
27:30.000 --> 27:31.120
Well,

404
27:31.720 --> 27:32.560
good luck.

405
27:36.840 --> 27:38.560
Have a safe trip.

406
27:39.160 --> 27:40.160
Good luck.

407
27:41.040 --> 27:42.200
Let's hug.

408
27:42.800 --> 27:44.200
Have a safe trip.

409
27:44.280 --> 27:45.240
Come on.

410
27:45.320 --> 27:48.360
-Come on. -Don't forget the souvenirs you promised.

411
27:49.200 --> 27:50.120
I know.

412
28:22.000 --> 28:23.000
Rakkhun.

413
28:23.920 --> 28:24.920
How did you get here?

414
28:28.440 --> 28:30.440
Linda asked me to return this book to you.

415
28:40.520 --> 28:42.600
Do you seriously not care about me?

416
28:42.680 --> 28:44.120
You're leaving tomorrow.

417
28:44.880 --> 28:46.480
Are you really leaving like this?

418
28:52.960 --> 28:54.440
Let me ask you honestly.

419
28:54.520 --> 28:56.680
Have you never felt anything for me?

420
29:00.400 --> 29:02.400
You're my client.

421
29:02.480 --> 29:03.960
I don't know if you can tell,

422
29:04.040 --> 29:05.440
but I'm a professional.

423
29:06.760 --> 29:08.080
Then when you kissed me,

424
29:08.960 --> 29:09.920
slept with me,

425
29:10.960 --> 29:11.920
kept messaging me,

426
29:12.000 --> 29:14.040
stayed up all night building the model for me,

427
29:14.760 --> 29:16.560
was all of that just for work?

428
29:19.440 --> 29:21.240
What will you get from asking me?

429
29:22.040 --> 29:23.720
I'm going to Japan tomorrow.

430
29:25.040 --> 29:26.480
I can wait for you.

431
29:27.160 --> 29:28.480
If nothing's holding you back.

432
29:30.920 --> 29:32.320
I can't take care of you.

433
29:33.160 --> 29:34.440
Look at me.

434
29:36.200 --> 29:37.560
I'm a loser.

435
29:39.400 --> 29:40.520
We're not right for each other.

436
29:41.560 --> 29:43.200
I don't care about that.

437
29:44.400 --> 29:46.080
No matter how different we are,

438
29:46.160 --> 29:48.200
I'm willing to adjust.

439
29:49.320 --> 29:51.000
I can take responsibility for your life

440
29:51.080 --> 29:52.680
and everyone in it.

441
29:57.160 --> 29:59.200
I know you get lonely.

442
30:00.360 --> 30:01.920
If you date me,

443
30:02.920 --> 30:04.200
even with a boyfriend,

444
30:05.040 --> 30:07.000
you'll still have to eat alone,

445
30:07.080 --> 30:08.560
sleep alone,

446
30:09.200 --> 30:10.440
and work on models alone.

447
30:11.480 --> 30:13.320
You won't have anyone to vent to.

448
30:13.400 --> 30:16.400
-But I can call you, can't I? -Yes, but I won't be here.

449
30:18.440 --> 30:20.960
Do you really think you can handle a long-distance relationship?

450
30:27.520 --> 30:29.320
Choose someone who can be there for you.

451
30:29.400 --> 30:30.400
Like Kan.

452
30:31.480 --> 30:32.560
I looked into him.

453
30:33.480 --> 30:34.840
He's got everything going for him.

454
30:35.960 --> 30:37.800
His family is loaded.

455
30:37.880 --> 30:39.240
He has a future.

456
30:39.840 --> 30:41.080
His family name is well-known too.

457
30:41.880 --> 30:43.160
He can easily take care of you.

458
30:47.960 --> 30:50.080
I can't date Kan anymore.

459
30:51.120 --> 30:52.920
I only have feelings…

460
30:54.840 --> 30:56.400
for you now.

461
31:01.760 --> 31:03.280
I feel at ease

462
31:04.960 --> 31:06.560
and I feel safe

463
31:06.640 --> 31:07.840
when I'm with you.

464
31:13.000 --> 31:14.560
But if I'm not here,

465
31:14.640 --> 31:16.760
that sense of comfort will change.

466
31:19.280 --> 31:21.680
I don't want the good feelings we have today

467
31:21.760 --> 31:23.040
to turn into hate.

468
31:25.760 --> 31:27.800
I think we should stop while things are still good.

469
31:40.600 --> 31:42.600
Then, can I have one last moment…

470
31:46.280 --> 31:47.720
with you?

471
33:19.920 --> 33:21.040
You can see me off here.

472
33:21.120 --> 33:22.520
You don't have to take me to the airport.

473
33:24.960 --> 33:27.800
When you graduate, don't forget to invite me.

474
33:28.480 --> 33:30.040
Just think of me as a younger brother.

475
33:30.120 --> 33:32.080
I just want to congratulate you.

476
33:33.760 --> 33:34.800
Sure.

477
33:35.840 --> 33:36.880
I'll invite you.

478
33:40.320 --> 33:41.960
In two years, when I graduate,

479
33:42.040 --> 33:43.360
I'll come back here.

480
33:45.040 --> 33:46.320
By then,

481
33:46.920 --> 33:48.360
if you're still single,

482
33:50.960 --> 33:52.200
shall we date then?

483
33:54.520 --> 33:55.960
But you don't have to wait for me.

484
33:56.040 --> 33:58.080
If you find someone better than me, go for it.

485
33:59.960 --> 34:01.840
Take good care of yourself from now on.

486
34:02.600 --> 34:04.200
Be happy, okay?

487
34:05.840 --> 34:07.600
If you want me to be happy,

488
34:08.960 --> 34:10.760
then hurry back to me.

489
34:18.239 --> 34:19.080
Well,

490
34:19.159 --> 34:20.120
I'm going.

491
34:20.840 --> 34:21.960
Wait.

492
34:44.600 --> 34:45.719
Good luck.

493
35:24.680 --> 35:26.280
THE CROW CLUB

494
35:32.840 --> 35:35.280
I thought I'd come to terms with being apart from Vann.

495
35:36.440 --> 35:37.520
But now I know

496
35:37.600 --> 35:39.200
it's just so hard.

497
35:40.840 --> 35:42.520
He'll be back soon.

498
35:42.600 --> 35:45.400
He's just checking out the dorm and sorting things out at the university.

499
35:45.480 --> 35:47.000
He hasn't even started studying yet.

500
35:47.720 --> 35:49.560
Knowing Vann, he'll probably stay there.

501
35:49.640 --> 35:51.360
He probably won't come back and waste the money.

502
35:52.480 --> 35:53.760
That mouth of yours.

503
35:53.840 --> 35:56.920
You barely ever talk. Why now? He's already upset.

504
35:57.440 --> 35:59.000
-Yeah. -Well, it's the truth.

505
35:59.080 --> 36:01.560
You don't have to say every truth out loud.

506
36:02.640 --> 36:03.520
Sorry.

507
36:05.400 --> 36:07.360
I don't think I can handle this.

508
36:08.600 --> 36:10.600
What am I gonna do? It's two whole years.

509
36:11.920 --> 36:13.840
What if someone hits on him?

510
36:15.480 --> 36:17.800
Don't worry about that, Rakkhun.

511
36:17.880 --> 36:19.640
Vann really only has his looks.

512
36:19.720 --> 36:21.880
When it comes to anything else, he's clueless.

513
36:21.960 --> 36:23.760
He wouldn't even know if someone hit on him.

514
36:32.320 --> 36:33.680
He's got it bad.

515
36:34.440 --> 36:35.360
True.

516
36:38.240 --> 36:40.520
Long-distance relationships

517
36:40.600 --> 36:42.000
really are hard.

518
36:45.000 --> 36:47.160
But if I knew where I stood with him,

519
36:47.760 --> 36:49.640
maybe I could do something.

520
36:51.240 --> 36:52.920
But I can't do anything.

521
36:55.680 --> 36:57.640
I don't know where I fit into the equation.

522
37:13.160 --> 37:14.640
From now on, when you're sad,

523
37:14.720 --> 37:16.080
look at this bracelet

524
37:16.160 --> 37:17.880
and think of me instead, okay?

525
37:25.720 --> 37:28.640
TOKYO, JAPAN

526
37:36.200 --> 37:38.480
You made Rakkhun sad.

527
37:39.880 --> 37:41.360
You're dead!

528
38:00.880 --> 38:03.480
Rakkhun's life was ruined because of a man.

529
38:04.280 --> 38:05.680
You must take responsibility.

530
38:06.360 --> 38:07.560
Wait.

531
38:07.640 --> 38:09.480
Calm down. Let's talk this through.

532
38:09.560 --> 38:11.280
I just got here.

533
38:11.360 --> 38:13.240
Can't you give me time to get over my jet lag?

534
38:13.320 --> 38:14.680
According to our deal,

535
38:14.760 --> 38:16.920
if Rakkhun gets his heart broken,

536
38:17.000 --> 38:18.120
you must die.

537
38:19.360 --> 38:21.760
Rakkhun is hurting because of you now.

538
38:22.280 --> 38:24.560
How could he be hurting because of me?

539
38:24.640 --> 38:26.240
You're just looking for an excuse to kill me.

540
38:26.760 --> 38:28.920
I won't let you get me that easily.

541
38:29.000 --> 38:30.800
Rakkhun loves you.

542
38:36.360 --> 38:38.360
Like I loved Chanta.

543
38:45.960 --> 38:47.440
Walk slowly.

544
38:47.520 --> 38:49.640
-Watch your step. -Don't fall.

545
38:49.720 --> 38:53.320
I once had a love like Rakkhun's too.

546
39:01.080 --> 39:03.280
It was all impossible.

547
39:04.880 --> 39:07.000
Garlah! Chanta!

548
39:15.720 --> 39:16.720
Enough!

549
39:32.680 --> 39:33.720
Chanta.

550
39:37.240 --> 39:38.600
Chanta.

551
39:40.440 --> 39:41.400
Chanta.

552
39:44.040 --> 39:44.960
Chanta.

553
39:55.160 --> 39:56.240
Chanta.

554
40:00.640 --> 40:01.680
Chanta.

555
40:01.760 --> 40:03.640
Because we loved the wrong gender,

556
40:03.720 --> 40:08.240
Chanta and I had to suffer the consequences.

557
40:57.360 --> 40:59.880
So I must protect my descendants

558
40:59.960 --> 41:01.920
from living a life like mine.

559
41:03.040 --> 41:05.560
Rakkhun is a lot like me.

560
41:07.040 --> 41:09.600
I won't let him end up like me.

561
41:11.120 --> 41:13.160
You said Rakkhun loves me, right?

562
41:13.760 --> 41:14.720
Yes.

563
41:15.520 --> 41:17.160
Rakkhun loves you.

564
41:17.760 --> 41:20.960
But his life is about to fall apart because of you!

565
41:23.240 --> 41:25.760
What if I can make Rakkhun happy?

566
41:26.400 --> 41:29.480
If I can keep Rakkhun from ending up like you,

567
41:29.560 --> 41:30.680
will you agree?

568
41:30.760 --> 41:32.200
Don't try to trick me.

569
41:42.800 --> 41:45.320
You said Rakkhun is like you, didn't you?

570
41:46.520 --> 41:47.880
If I die,

571
41:48.880 --> 41:51.280
he'll suffer like you did.

572
41:53.480 --> 41:55.960
I'll stake my whole life on this.

573
41:56.560 --> 41:58.360
I love Rakkhun.

574
42:00.680 --> 42:01.760
I want

575
42:01.840 --> 42:03.480
him to be happy.

576
42:24.040 --> 42:26.000
Let me take care of Rakkhun.

577
42:45.560 --> 42:49.080
Rakkhun, for the assignment the professor wants revised, how about this topic?

578
42:49.160 --> 42:50.600
Which one? This one or this one?

579
42:50.680 --> 42:51.600
This one.

580
42:52.280 --> 42:54.160
-Or this one? -It's interesting.

581
42:55.680 --> 42:56.840
How about this one?

582
42:56.920 --> 42:58.680
-This one looks okay too. -Rakkhun.

583
43:10.440 --> 43:11.880
Hey,

584
43:11.960 --> 43:13.200
what are you wearing?

585
43:13.840 --> 43:15.000
Is this some new fashion?

586
43:19.000 --> 43:20.360
It's vintage.

587
43:21.400 --> 43:22.440
Well? Does it suit me?

588
43:23.960 --> 43:25.160
Well,

589
43:25.240 --> 43:26.840
it looks a little forced.

590
43:27.800 --> 43:29.320
But it's not bad.

591
43:34.720 --> 43:36.960
You still haven't finished your assignment?

592
43:37.960 --> 43:38.800
Oh.

593
43:38.880 --> 43:40.400
The professor told us to revise it.

594
43:42.280 --> 43:44.600
What about yours? Have you done it yet?

595
43:44.680 --> 43:46.720
I'm done. Want me to help?

596
43:47.760 --> 43:50.480
For you, I'll help for free.

597
43:51.640 --> 43:53.120
I'd even help you for life.

598
44:00.320 --> 44:01.320
Kan.

599
44:03.360 --> 44:04.760
I have something to tell you.

600
44:06.840 --> 44:08.560
I want to make things clear with you.

601
44:17.200 --> 44:19.000
You don't like me anymore, do you?

602
44:24.960 --> 44:26.640
I could kind of tell.

603
44:28.800 --> 44:30.480
But do I really have no chance anymore?

604
44:33.640 --> 44:36.000
I don't feel that way about you anymore.

605
44:36.600 --> 44:37.840
I like someone else now.

606
44:39.560 --> 44:40.800
The guy…

607
44:41.800 --> 44:43.160
named Vann?

608
44:44.640 --> 44:45.640
Yes.

609
44:46.760 --> 44:48.480
I'm waiting for him to come back.

610
44:49.760 --> 44:51.080
I'll wait for him to come back.

611
44:53.640 --> 44:55.640
I can only be your friend.

612
44:57.240 --> 44:59.080
But if you can't be friends with me,

613
44:59.640 --> 45:01.000
I understand.

614
45:04.720 --> 45:06.360
I'll probably need some time.

615
45:32.280 --> 45:33.760
POWERFUL EARTHQUAKE STRIKES JAPAN

616
45:36.000 --> 45:38.040
VANN

617
45:56.040 --> 45:57.400
Talay.

618
45:57.480 --> 45:59.400
Did you see the news about the earthquake in Japan?

619
46:00.080 --> 46:02.120
It's the same city Vann is in.

620
46:02.200 --> 46:04.400
Can you contact him?

621
46:04.480 --> 46:06.360
He's not answering our calls either.

622
46:06.440 --> 46:09.240
Linda is contacting his dorm now.

623
46:09.760 --> 46:11.760
I'll let you know as soon as I hear anything.

624
46:13.520 --> 46:15.600
Okay. Keep me updated.

625
46:15.680 --> 46:16.680
Okay.

626
46:30.320 --> 46:31.760
The flight was canceled?

627
46:31.840 --> 46:33.600
Are there any other flights?

628
46:34.200 --> 46:35.280
Okay.

629
46:46.040 --> 46:47.120
Vann!

630
46:53.640 --> 46:54.720
How are you?

631
46:55.240 --> 46:56.720
Are you hurt anywhere?

632
46:59.440 --> 47:00.320
I'm fine.

633
47:21.800 --> 47:23.280
I'm really fine.

634
47:23.360 --> 47:24.560
Why are you crying?

635
47:29.120 --> 47:32.000
I turned on my phone and saw almost 100 missed calls.

636
47:32.080 --> 47:33.160
From you,

637
47:33.240 --> 47:35.200
Talay, and Linda.

638
47:35.760 --> 47:37.640
My phone was about to explode.

639
47:37.720 --> 47:39.960
Well, everyone was worried about you.

640
47:40.040 --> 47:42.280
We thought you might've died in the earthquake.

641
47:45.080 --> 47:46.880
When the earthquake hit,

642
47:46.960 --> 47:48.960
I thought I was going to die too.

643
47:49.040 --> 47:50.880
You can still joke about it?

644
47:54.200 --> 47:55.800
When I took cover under a table

645
47:56.560 --> 47:58.080
and the building shook,

646
47:58.160 --> 48:00.360
the ceiling came crashing down right in front of me.

647
48:01.720 --> 48:03.560
My mind suddenly went blank.

648
48:06.360 --> 48:07.680
You were the first person I thought of.

649
48:10.320 --> 48:11.560
Before I knew it,

650
48:12.640 --> 48:15.360
I'd booked the first flight back to Thailand to see you.

651
48:17.400 --> 48:18.600
You did the right thing.

652
48:19.120 --> 48:20.720
You made the right choice.

653
48:22.760 --> 48:23.880
I don't think

654
48:25.160 --> 48:27.440
we're cut out for a long-distance relationship.

655
48:29.600 --> 48:30.600
Why?

656
48:36.880 --> 48:38.760
But I want to take a chance.

657
48:39.360 --> 48:41.080
There's nothing more regrettable than

658
48:41.160 --> 48:42.920
deciding without even trying.

659
48:45.800 --> 48:47.000
I want to be your boyfriend.

660
48:48.240 --> 48:49.200
Can I?

661
49:07.560 --> 49:08.600
You're speechless.

662
49:11.040 --> 49:13.120
Rakkhun, will you be my boyfriend?

663
49:15.320 --> 49:16.280
Yes.

664
49:17.600 --> 49:19.880
So, we're boyfriends now, right?

665
49:20.720 --> 49:21.600
Yes.

666
49:24.400 --> 49:25.760
But before we tell anyone,

667
49:26.360 --> 49:28.040
there's something you need to know.

668
49:28.120 --> 49:30.720
I made a deal with Garlah, staking my life

669
49:30.800 --> 49:32.440
so she'd let you go.

670
49:33.600 --> 49:34.760
I told her

671
49:35.600 --> 49:37.520
if you get your heart broken because of a man,

672
49:37.600 --> 49:39.360
I'd let her kill me.

673
49:39.960 --> 49:41.680
Why would you do that?

674
49:42.800 --> 49:44.880
If she takes your life,

675
49:45.480 --> 49:46.720
how am I supposed to live?

676
49:48.800 --> 49:50.160
When I saw her,

677
49:51.280 --> 49:53.520
I realized how much you were suffering.

678
49:55.280 --> 49:56.120
Rakkhun.

679
49:56.800 --> 50:00.200
Now I know I'm the only one who can make you happy.

680
50:05.720 --> 50:07.200
That's so fucking touching, right?

681
50:08.240 --> 50:10.160
You're so extreme.

682
50:10.760 --> 50:13.240
When you act like this, it's not cute.

683
50:13.920 --> 50:17.120
If I'm like this, will you still love me?

684
50:20.280 --> 50:21.200
Of course.

685
50:21.840 --> 50:23.120
I love you so much.

686
50:24.840 --> 50:26.680
If you ever leave me,

687
50:27.440 --> 50:29.520
I'll have Garlah snap your neck.

688
51:25.640 --> 51:27.880
I hope this love of yours

689
51:29.160 --> 51:30.800
brings you happiness.

690
51:30.880 --> 51:31.880
Rakkhun.

691
51:34.640 --> 51:35.480
Vann,

692
51:35.560 --> 51:36.480
are you okay?

693
51:38.480 --> 51:39.720
I thought I heard something.

694
51:40.640 --> 51:41.640
I must've imagined it.

695
51:58.880 --> 51:59.960
Hey, Vann.

696
52:01.400 --> 52:03.200
There was an earthquake. You didn't answer my calls,

697
52:03.280 --> 52:05.240
but you just show up here?

698
52:05.320 --> 52:06.240
What?

699
52:06.320 --> 52:08.560
I already talked to Linda.

700
52:08.640 --> 52:09.960
Right, Linda?

701
52:10.640 --> 52:12.400
He's just making a fuss.

702
52:12.480 --> 52:13.680
I knew.

703
52:14.920 --> 52:17.160
Didn't you say you'd be back in two years?

704
52:18.800 --> 52:20.240
I shouldn't have cried over you.

705
52:24.160 --> 52:25.760
Whoa.

706
52:30.960 --> 52:34.680
So the bracelet I gave you really worked.

707
52:34.760 --> 52:36.720
Why did you come back, though?

708
52:37.440 --> 52:39.000
I just came to get some documents.

709
52:39.520 --> 52:42.440
Once I submit them, that's it.

710
52:45.640 --> 52:47.880
Just admit you missed us.

711
52:47.960 --> 52:49.360
You dinosaur.

712
52:52.120 --> 52:53.680
He doesn't mean us.

713
52:54.360 --> 52:56.400
He missed Rakkhun.

714
52:56.920 --> 52:58.080
Of course.

715
52:58.160 --> 53:01.000
Of course I missed my boyfriend more than you guys.

716
53:02.640 --> 53:04.000
Okay.

717
53:04.080 --> 53:06.960
Wait, are you guys dating now?

718
53:07.040 --> 53:09.760
Who asked who out first?

719
53:10.400 --> 53:11.360
Hey.

720
53:11.440 --> 53:14.480
Tell us everything. Every last detail.

721
53:15.680 --> 53:17.680
Want me to write you a report?

722
53:17.760 --> 53:18.760
That would be nice.

723
53:19.800 --> 53:21.480
Just knowing we're dating is enough.

724
53:22.640 --> 53:24.440
Linda!

725
53:24.520 --> 53:27.000
Someone broke the rules. Shouldn't he be kicked out?

726
53:35.680 --> 53:38.800
If breaking the rules helps the Crows learn,

727
53:39.640 --> 53:40.760
I'm okay with it.

728
53:42.080 --> 53:44.680
Because now, Rakkhun

729
53:44.760 --> 53:47.880
is part of our Crow Club family.

730
53:50.360 --> 53:52.200
Take good care of Rakkhun.

731
53:52.960 --> 53:54.520
He's better than you at everything,

732
53:54.600 --> 53:56.000
and he still chose you.

733
53:56.080 --> 53:57.320
Don't let him down.

734
53:57.400 --> 53:58.640
Hey.

735
53:58.720 --> 54:00.320
I'm your little brother, remember?

736
54:00.400 --> 54:02.000
You should be tough on him.

737
54:02.080 --> 54:04.160
Like a big brother protecting his little brother.

738
54:04.760 --> 54:05.680
Why would we be protective of you?

739
54:06.280 --> 54:07.920
If Rakkhun doesn't want you, no one will.

740
54:09.360 --> 54:10.560
That's true.

741
54:10.640 --> 54:13.280
I never thought someone like you could get a boyfriend.

742
54:15.280 --> 54:16.480
So I got myself a rare one?

743
54:17.920 --> 54:19.320
Limited edition.

744
54:20.400 --> 54:22.440
While I'm in Japan, take care of Rakkhun for me.

745
54:22.520 --> 54:25.840
If anyone hits on him, beat them up. You have my permission.

746
54:27.680 --> 54:29.280
-Calm down. -Okay.

747
54:32.560 --> 54:35.480
Vann. About the deal you made with Garlah…

748
54:35.560 --> 54:38.040
She won't come back for your life later, right?

749
54:38.640 --> 54:39.720
No.

750
54:39.800 --> 54:41.640
If I don't hurt you, she won't come.

751
54:42.280 --> 54:44.400
And I'd never do that anyway.

752
54:45.440 --> 54:47.080
That's easy to say now.

753
54:47.960 --> 54:50.280
We'll have to see what happens from now on.

754
54:50.960 --> 54:52.480
Then keep watching.

755
54:54.120 --> 54:57.440
Thank you for never letting go of me.

756
55:01.840 --> 55:04.240
Can you say what you just said again?

757
55:04.840 --> 55:05.880
Which part?

758
55:05.960 --> 55:07.400
When I told them

759
55:07.480 --> 55:09.480
if anyone hits on you, they can beat them up?

760
55:09.560 --> 55:10.680
No.

761
55:11.400 --> 55:13.640
What you said we are.

762
55:19.640 --> 55:22.040
You're the only boyfriend I love.

763
55:25.520 --> 55:27.160
I love you, Rakkhun.

764
56:59.880 --> 57:01.280
Someone once told me,

765
57:01.360 --> 57:03.240
if I can't write what I want to write right now,

766
57:03.320 --> 57:04.680
I should write something else first.

767
57:04.760 --> 57:06.480
Want to have some fun with adult fiction?

768
57:06.560 --> 57:08.040
What happened to your hand?

769
57:08.120 --> 57:09.280
Who did this to you? Tell me.

770
57:09.360 --> 57:10.840
Why do you care about me?

771
57:10.920 --> 57:12.680
Vann really doesn't have someone else, right?

772
57:12.760 --> 57:14.960
I've gone through three decks already.

773
57:15.040 --> 57:17.560
Vann could never pull anyone else anyway.

774
57:17.640 --> 57:21.480
I told you, if you can't find a main vocalist with a distinctive voice,

775
57:21.560 --> 57:23.280
I don't know why you should debut.

776
57:23.360 --> 57:24.400
If he doesn't join us,

777
57:24.480 --> 57:25.840
we'll have to change our plans.

778
57:25.920 --> 57:26.800
Trust me.

779
57:26.880 --> 57:29.800
This time, he'll definitely say yes.
